[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18241.99, "timestamp": "05:04:01", "text": "他的头发和一切都那么……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18244.39, "timestamp": "05:04:04", "text": "光滑的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18248.628, "timestamp": "05:04:08", "text": "啊，对，他就是那个……哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18252.39, "timestamp": "05:04:12", "text": "耶，宝贝。那是我们都想要的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18254.31, "timestamp": "05:04:14", "text": "就是他，对吧？就是他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18256.55, "timestamp": "05:04:16", "text": "正确的？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18260.07, "timestamp": "05:04:20", "text": "我知道他那湿漉漉的小东西是干这个的。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18262.55, "timestamp": "05:04:22", "text": "注意观察湿度计。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18264.788, "timestamp": "05:04:24", "text": "每当有新游戏推出的时候，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18267.67, "timestamp": "05:04:27", "text": "他出来后，赚的钱最多，或者说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18271.35, "timestamp": "05:04:31", "text": "非常受欢迎的电影或其他任何东西。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18280.788, "timestamp": "05:04:40", "text": "你好，蓝猫。是的。你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18283.59, "timestamp": "05:04:43", "text": "欢迎。欢迎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18288.15, "timestamp": "05:04:48", "text": "好的。你好，猫咪。等等，情况怎么样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18290.788, "timestamp": "05:04:50", "text": "这些人是那家公司的一部分。总之，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18295.19, "timestamp": "05:04:55", "text": "是一家科技公司。哦，是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18297.99, "timestamp": "05:04:57", "text": "科技公司？我不知道。我看到了。"}]